scripts, documentation and one derived data file.

The build entry in `gog-1.5.6-c59754b9.json` was derived independently from a
legally owned GOG copy of the game. It contains addresses (RVAs) of functions
in that copy; addresses are facts, not copied works. No original `builds.json`
